  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "92413c290bb131d5d93f9c009fe9ecad",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-004_Consolidation_MVD_DN40-50_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. In addition to the consolidation of the MVD threaded versions Rp 3/8” to Rp 2 ½” also to MVD flanged versions DN 40 – DN 50 will be phased out and replaced by new established order numbers. The phase out will take place by the end of Q2/2025 (June 30th., 2025).\n\nThere will be a last time buy option until April 30th., 2025.\n\nSpare parts for the previous MVD flanged versions will be available until the end of Q4/2025 (Dec. 31st. 2025).",
    "metadata": {
      "data_source": {
        "record_locator": {
          "path": "/Users/riccardodestratis/PycharmProjects/dungs_poc/documents-one/RepNews_2025-004_Consolidation_MVD_DN40-50_1R0.pdf"
